  "description": "Kon\u0101r Sandal is a Bronze Age archaeological site associated with the \"Jiroft culture\" (third millennium BCE). The site is located in the valley of the Halil River just south of Jiroft, Kerm\u0101n Province, Iran. There are, in fact, two tells situated a few kilometers apart. By convention, these mounds are referred to as Konar Sandal A and B.",
